## Add New Version to the Versions popup

Context: Users can now branch the open domain directly from the global
Versions popup without navigating to Domain → Versions. Both entry points use
one shared create-version workflow and preserve the existing ungated behavior.
After popup confirmation, the popup closes and the branded full-page loading
overlay remains visible until the new version loads; failures restore the
popup.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/global/js/navbar.js
   Added the popup button, shared global create-version action, loading overlay
   lifecycle, and popup failure recovery.
2. src/front/static/domain/js/domain-versions.js
   Delegated Domain → Versions creation to the shared global action.
3. tests/units/front/test_create_version_ungated.py
   Added contracts for shared, ungated version creation and loading recovery.
4. tests/units/front/test_switch_domain_modal.py
   Added the popup button, ordering, icon, label, and contextual binding
   contract.
5. docs/superpowers/specs/2026-09-05-versions-popup-new-version-design.md
   Documented the approved user experience and shared-action design.
6. docs/superpowers/plans/2026-09-05-versions-popup-new-version.md
   Recorded the test-first implementation and verification plan.

